OL,3,GNEWSAElusive deep-diving whale washes
OL,4,Aup on south of Scotland beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deep-diving beaked whale has died
OL,7,Fafter becoming stranded on a beach in
OL,8,Fthe south of Scotland.
OL,10,FStaff at a nearby hotel raised the
OL,11,Falarm after spotting the animal in
OL,12,FBalcary Bay near Auchencairn earlier
OL,13,Fthis week.
OL,15,FIt is believed to be a Sowerby's beaked
OL,16,Fwhale and the Scottish Marine Animal
OL,17,FStranding Scheme (SMASS) hopes to carry
OL,18,Fout an examination in the coming days.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
