OL,3,GNEWSAElusive deep-diving whale washes
OL,4,Aup on south of Scotland beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe whales are a deep-diving species,
OL,7,Frarely seen at sea and can spend long
OL,8,Fperiods underwater hunting squid and
OL,9,Ffish.
